# CONNECTRAG — PREMIUM AI RESEARCH & CONNECTIVITY-AWARE RAG DASHBOARD

## 1. PROJECT OVERVIEW

Design a visually exceptional, high-fidelity, multi-page web application for **ConnectRAG**, a connectivity-aware Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) platform designed to maintain access to knowledge when internet connectivity becomes weak, unstable, or unavailable.

ConnectRAG intelligently demonstrates a three-tier retrieval architecture:

- Tier 1: Cloud RAG — hosted retrieval and LLM inference when network quality is good.
- Tier 2: Local RAG — locally available retrieval and local LLM inference when connectivity deteriorates.
- Tier 3: Cached Knowledge — instant access to previously stored answers when connectivity is severely degraded or unavailable.

The system uses a Network Quality Score (NQS) and connectivity signals to determine the appropriate retrieval strategy.

This web application has two major purposes:

**A. Data Lab:** Visualize the real dataset preparation and training statistics generated during development.

**B. Live Demo:** Demonstrate the intended behavior of ConnectRAG through a polished, interactive connectivity simulation. This section is a frontend prototype and must not imply that the backend orchestrator is already implemented.

The product should feel like a serious AI infrastructure startup combined with a sophisticated research laboratory dashboard. It should be suitable for research presentations, mentor reviews, technical demonstrations, and eventual production development.

